=== [7] Contract H schema validation (stdout is clean machine-readable JSON) ===
Progress lines ([nvcc]/[ptxas]/[analyze]) go to stderr; ONLY the report is on stdout.
VALID JSON, parses with json.load
top-level keys: ['arch', 'backend', 'bottleneck', 'kernel', 'occupancy', 'path', 'registers_per_thread', 'smem_per_block_bytes', 'spill_loads_bytes', 'spill_stores_bytes', 'suggested_fixes', 'traffic']
occupancy keys: ['active_warps_per_sm', 'limiter', 'max_warps_per_sm', 'occupancy_pct']
traffic keys: ['arithmetic_intensity_flop_per_byte', 'global_read_bytes', 'global_write_bytes', 'roofline']
enums -> limiter:registers roofline:memory-bound bottleneck:memory path:scalar backend:cuda

